script = ExtResource("1_s")
id = "world_warden"
display_name = "The Warden"
title = "The Warden"
category = 0
unlock_act = 0
order = 3
art = "res://art/story/story_warden.png"
body = "One defender, bound to one beast. The Warden carries a lantern because Yuri walks through the night as readily as the day, and a blade because the roads are never empty for long. They build on the roads during Preparation and hold them during the fight; they raid the camps that harry the beast, fish the ponds beyond the paths, bond the animals that live off them, and come back to the town between runs a little more than they were.\n\nLevelling and gear are the two ways a Warden grows, and both are capped. Everything else the Warden finds - relics, cards, portents - belongs to a run and is lost with it. That is the shape of the game: the road is long, and you walk it more than once."
